# Feature / UX Audit Command

When the user says **"run feature audit"**, **"feature audit"**, **"run ux audit"**, or **"ux audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose or explore) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/feature-ux-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/feature/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-ux-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/feature-ux-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/feature/`
